### Login bằng Client Credentials
# @name getToken
POST {{keycloakUrl}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id={{clientId}}&client_secret={{clientSecret}}

### Get User By Id
GET http://localhost:9000/api/v1/user/3
Authorization: Bearer {{getToken.response.body.access_token}}

client_id=home-energy-tracker-client
&client_secret=tUOX8aVExqB3yCd2Q3LmLaAlS0TnCq9I

